Subject:
UDC-22-00425 | Dell Range Addition, 6th Filing Final Plat (5908 Ridge Road)
Date:
January 23, 2023
Background:
The item for consideration is a Final Plat.  This is approved by Resolution.
The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
Introduction and Referral
1/23/2023
Public Services Committee
2/7/2023
Consideration
2/13/2023
Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their January 3, 2023 meeting and recommended the
Governing Body approve this application (and grant the exception listed in the Staff Report) by a vote of
4-3. This recommendation allowed the final plat to be brought forward with the zoning map
amendment (instead of just a preliminary plat). The applicant has indicated a willingness to withdraw
the plat should the zoning map amendment not be approved.
The Planning Commission Staff report is attached and has not been changed.
Related Items:
